  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bf99df0127a582bd4ffb1b03",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「白色闪电」登场！\r\n……嘿嘿，很有型对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e0176cab83cde4b2407bd1633fc935dc126d709f6d2059edb62427da9e1313",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "70009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aa78c7afed8fd84edd299af0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用旧的物品居然可以换成新的。\r\n……特雷森学园也太猛了吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "afc4823e5125e5e768ed95e82f3caf282a4b482f7ac4540277fbc89cac30c4a6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "70010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3a310a78b32d76bbfbacb1b6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "弹性也太好了吧。\r\n多亏如此，在舞台上也很好活动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e372e31498a055cbd703b421c0c97bb0cc66ae785bab9710963fe0f5be2aef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "70014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab2bc324861dcc42d8f374a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是专属于我的服装，不会让其他人穿。\r\n──跟尺寸无关喔！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b1c3a815a98ba9e9b476febe989b1d9f180af4a3616d32f79beef8678adab87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "70015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b6560e0bb6e4d32e09cd57fc",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身打扮怎么样？\r\n很像只要崇拜我就会受保佑吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c7276faf5296372fed592f02b4cd4dabab894f7a5cf697bb840dfdc43475ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "70016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:83b0c4024486e1a660402721",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不小心靠太近可是会被电得发麻喔！\r\n说笑的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eb7e7650ee7b66ce508271be8cab8a20fa36e786e45f8841458f7f25de4371a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "70017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ac806c0be91b09b8aa280270",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？这样也不错吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "104d757b7f4c584fffbdce3d3f958ef514007810cf69b4533de07fd3eb16d694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "70018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:268ed54dded97e892726b3ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊，就去跑一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14b0fb64629c555946c5cb641cf00611f873148e37db02fee97b68fdc740636",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "70019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a81bc042deb7ccf6a217f8f8",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "着替えたで～どっか出かけるん？",
      "source_fingerprint": "53d0f0a18a030b6f583db756f2dbaaf8c8f63b39fc8bf2eaf916edd85b2088aa",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "70020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:deff6742d225ec4c53d087e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "買うた時はもっと背ぇ伸びると\r\n思っとったんやけどな…。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b62f0994f8ca8e39ef0bcc95abcaea72e11fa559bc252e195a5377484e6c5904",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "70021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b0435da836d3987d350ca124",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "以日常服装来说还真讲究啊～\r\n要是在我老家，这就算是最棒的衣服咯。",
      "source_fingerprint": "4cb196617db59c4cf8ea4e714f97876103723a2838e612eb5be0c012bd46b8c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "71004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a4fa53d7d99a6d19cc273d1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "哎呀～光是能穿上这么豪华的服装，\r\n就不枉费我努力跑步了，认真的。",
      "source_fingerprint": "a0481837acf6172ad7c9744d3b894deb82c41b830d2852fe8e54b6103a11e692",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "71008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c33d49db5fe721775acd9563",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "「白色闪电」登场！\r\n……嘿嘿，很有型对吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "01e0176cab83cde4b2407bd1633fc935dc126d709f6d2059edb62427da9e1313",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "71009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:929cc7b99ca5cdff2b682535",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "用旧的物品居然可以换成新的。\r\n……特雷森学园也太猛了吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad34115189244782b18efa4af99efa74c0622d7a44af88eac38709db63b601c8",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "71010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4e71ba41c8391c2cef882577",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "弹性也太好了吧。\r\n多亏如此，在舞台上也很好活动。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e372e31498a055cbd703b421c0c97bb0cc66ae785bab9710963fe0f5be2aef9",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "71014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3cad3d540c06b5cc1948f98f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这是专属于我的服装，不会让其他人穿。\r\n──跟尺寸无关喔！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "5b1c3a815a98ba9e9b476febe989b1d9f180af4a3616d32f79beef8678adab87",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "71015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:449a3caab6c3a12416ac9a25",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这身打扮怎么样？\r\n很像只要崇拜我就会受保佑吧？",
      "source_fingerprint": "93c7276faf5296372fed592f02b4cd4dabab894f7a5cf697bb840dfdc43475ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "71016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8089823e2c140b4fbd3ea318",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不小心靠太近可是会被电得发麻喔！\r\n说笑的啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9eb7e7650ee7b66ce508271be8cab8a20fa36e786e45f8841458f7f25de4371a",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "71017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:17d013e4a9bf0344332ad4e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样？这样也不错吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "104d757b7f4c584fffbdce3d3f958ef514007810cf69b4533de07fd3eb16d694",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "71018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:419b7b24da39ccf3eb680043",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "好啊，就去跑一场吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "f14b0fb64629c555946c5cb641cf00611f873148e37db02fee97b68fdc740636",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "71019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:908701a77194b113a25e3468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "辛苦咯",
      "source_fingerprint": "4de56a033b1c5067e8eaeb2c516b716cf2300b569e4d10e945d3374069551549",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "80000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a9d9d1ad6820e8ecfa7b1a36",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "おっ、やるか？\r\nええで、胸貸したるわ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4bf0a0e1e64b63f05c27a031468b6ff8bb786e4f601e92631aa1b9195f287d25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "81000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db35c11e87157f1c4daf7597",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "やるやん！よっしゃ、\r\nウチも気合い入れてくで！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5e304731c2d195b3d4dbe380af67491b30a48a1e44ab1562ebcde9b71f3f8a05",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "81001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e326e965f987fe4662274662",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "早安啊！\r\n今天也要从早开始全力以赴！\r\n你要好好跟上我喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "6380c9c308c527ab64d0deeb627568cd11d59c7aed96a47dd1b0b03e4d37e641",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1a38d1f02bcb8190832cba52",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "帮我准备早餐，我真的很高兴……\r\n但唯独纳豆……！\r\n唯独那黏黏的口感……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "821a96935b7bc430d4862637c7fa8d580760749b28c2440dfccf39431fc4aa1c",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1ae4f9bfc97e7067b5e4940a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "状况怎么样？吃过午饭了吗？\r\n不动动身体，小心变猪喔！\r\n人家是这么说的啦，啊哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "804a2bfa12d7342459a91c0262f903db37bfeda112efe66ce08063f7785f351e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b69139731dcd326dd38b59c3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "你有看到小栗午餐的份量吗……？\r\n唔唔……光是回想起来，\r\n肚子就饱得不得了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4f9bae6d246b52e622cab0bea5d37d77226a0c765491ddbe4babcb35559167ab",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4c38f87001dfc5c46db79752",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "呼哇……你也忙到太晚了吧。\r\n真拿你没办法，就陪陪你吧──\r\n呼哇……",
      "source_fingerprint": "26ebe1a335084b06d42e8d4d2ffdab4850d43cb7853ad887b90685b87e0d11ce",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:65bbd44c06b6058de4cd0973",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我很习惯在深夜被吵起来。\r\n毕竟我都要照顾那些\r\n不是大哭就是吵闹的小不点嘛！",
      "source_fingerprint": "53fe2ab45634d4d4c41e3802f05f2fcb9d0c140cf27090ffb397fee52b72f8df",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ce538f6d0093e23f98154e09",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "到了身体测量的时期了呢……\r\n我绝不想输给稻荷……！\r\n我可是人小志气高……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "04fcc5de5af7e7aa446ea6ba237799d10f7045aba2cc87cbb507ae473dc2c1de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e4224dd8b80d811c3653fc7c",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "校舍跟宿舍总是开着冷气对吧？\r\n电费……大概多少钱啊？\r\n这问题让我超～～好奇的……",
      "source_fingerprint": "f52347ead499828d586009a93729c53c393e6a8485cb2eb80bf6ccc6db4630dd",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8f02e7882cff8d00bcd8ae59",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我以前很常捡银杏喔。\r\n现在看到也会忍不住捡起来──\r\n不……实际上有时候就是会跑去捡。",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b46919004b2419f2d21d1094c309a2d485580ff50282c99264887f6a300b79e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:dc4fa74cc85ad86d18c4e800",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "在老家时即使拿出暖炉桌，\r\n也不会插电。\r\n只要大家都进去就很暖，这样才省！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a43a30cd6e0048e285966c6c6e1274ecd14094a0a1081defcc71f15438b9a904",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e990f4c101529be17de0cd88",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "真是清爽的早上啊！\r\n今天也辛苦啦！\r\n得诚心感谢太阳公公才行！",
      "source_fingerprint": "c4792f28b0dc184d425800b19d41d687784535439c3836a259be6a7bcea9416d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c32c7685e4be5c9d2c9dba66",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "起个大早去神社散步，\r\n总觉得会让人精神为之一振呢，\r\n你也试看看吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "34ca3202eea8aae0837d3111af59527039fae51cc8998538011baea0cd9a027b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7f88d2016e27fa5049e72604",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "就说我胃口不大了，\r\n餐厅还老爱给我超大份量的餐……\r\n是当作在拜拜吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "e438fe2e916db3e7d48ef06431cf1c60e3f4762b2d533ec6f5f099e97d4bb416",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0557cca5df10ceda866bce56",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "吃饭前有先说「我要开动了」吗？\r\n对一切抱着感恩的心是很重要的喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3de3922a00c6fb6c5e8cf3d46a7fda8654ca0b2a4b55dc9e790ccc0471e2afc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9f0bf818a9d5fe361bab180",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "忙到这么晚真是辛苦啦！\r\n有困难时就是要互相帮助！\r\n如果有我能做的，我会奉陪到底喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "4b036e4d5a7acb7e27b73c67575d96d194868189751966796b4f5bf2614f2f54",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6036e77bbfb0d6f39e85336d",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "不敢一个人走夜路的话我可以陪你\r\n一起回去喔。看到我这身打扮，\r\n反倒是妖魔鬼怪要怕我啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "578111d742a66fa5c66a5ace3130f160b1417cd7e9637f355adeeec9e9f06432",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:db967b8e987487ea91e1aed1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "看我以白色春雷之姿，为新生们\r\n示范跑步的基础吧！让她们见识\r\n背负各种意念的跑姿长什么样子！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7445abd197b579c02d3d7bed6ea67570804f0601cfd95c2293ace9cbcf5f024b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:82ee086ab2c464d32120f2db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件和服裤的侧边有个大开口，\r\n刚穿上时总觉得不太自在……\r\n但天气热时还满凉爽的嘛～！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a692b54edc7a70ea21cd95f9350ccc21e61c148dfa2e38a04ac931abb114c670",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1d0d402a6bd5f9c1d4a4c044",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "现在可是打雷的季节，有没有\r\n什么供品啊～？像我老家的章鱼\r\n正好是产季，吃起来超有嚼劲说～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4d4ebfd77fa14782fcc1bc64d7ff1191ca61c98518f1be9ffd0b2d53c22334b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:697e537c2ccd8009386ee421",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天的时候神明也只要窝在神社里\r\n暖暖地度过就好了说。\r\n毕竟天气冷实在太难熬了……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e13ecbbe677bca19b9041740e5fc42bf7efa84c9d793026daaaafb54f3e31693",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6ee32df853fd0c8eb61c1128",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fcf91bfe47382364e66302db",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "情人节快乐！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d9e338ecc741ac949d3f240a82f8cc83ab075127e1514b8c6ff32e4c943f6fc6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "90021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:337327de93933a8b5572eea6",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "溪流的口袋到底是怎么回事……？\r\n为什么总是有拿不完的糖果！？\r\n越来越觉得可怕了……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "95b069ad4c4850b0919b057e39fc72c34480f7bafb5effc337ccb5fdd310fe61",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1e59ab1cc569d6759b61f92",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "跟装傻的人比起来吐槽的人\r\n实在严重不足……话说回来，\r\n大家的装傻也太有特色了吧……！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "1877908bd8a4832d58c6a36f92de1008a86beb754f4ba354c354601c73d84ada",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ba85f7a127d0a34a287d2468",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "城市好厉害啊。问她知道什么\r\n好服饰店吗？她就会推荐\r\n便宜又有品味的店家。真是可靠啊～",
      "source_fingerprint": "e1b1e4d034edeb369ecea2400245e62d072d04e5855cc2da9651de3bbbf32ec0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19bad5e194fa93accb1a8f7b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "青竹和进王在做什么……！？\r\n虽然很想问，\r\n但又不想知道……！！唔啊啊～！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8d91ec4b80f836e89af31de6bcdd453d7e247c9c9e6e5dcf740f4a81246bbd25",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91003"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:234410bf3f4d0b78baac93b1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "宿舍真是不错啊。\r\n总是会有人在，让人很踏实。\r\n感觉就像我老家一样～",
      "source_fingerprint": "192791c1b6d41c95b82db7c0b8b407f6608207f2cb426d3cc181fef4f8a78c7e",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91004"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e55f0732cf86373a3df3ee42",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "怎么样，穿上这套服装后，\r\n看起来有模有样了吧！只要穿成\r\n这样──呃，这个人是谁啊！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "7ddd330df5ff3d8e65e62ba6af001688f1e9438939e9f2978be029197695aacf",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91005"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a26276d70557b91882478476",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这件衣服啊，材质应该相当不错吧。\r\n话虽如此，我穿起来还是有点\r\n坐立难安……",
      "source_fingerprint": "081636301b84369b519e71cbcbff4e98ebbdd4ec28b1ec11a0307ea599c0ad5f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91006"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:72418ebde3a41cb0ed34756f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这就是「白色闪电」！！哎呀～\r\n彷佛能看到爸爸开心的神情喔。\r\n我会好好努力，不辜负他的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "154888e272fa492b31b9747fb09ff99839cb877fdd9f8024f0a3311b6c803fa0",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91007"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c19bdcb734e5b5fe73491cab",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "很帅气吧？看起来很快吧！？\r\n放心吧，我会让大家知道，\r\n我的速度真的很快！",
      "source_fingerprint": "665eff2060d7d8085dbc9df36d526aaf0a9e7c2c8ba1a28e2e438a1c739c31d3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91008"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea35dee7ae563bc9afc5040b",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "还想说一大早就听到不对劲的声响，\r\n原来是天狼星在健身房乱踢乱闹……\r\n她到底是想要踢什么！",
      "source_fingerprint": "a606f5bfa2f30227c80d74e2c90894e80e26383bbeb943f753360ef99fc920a2",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91009"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:918d9b6143d4e3d6f2691187",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "一讲到假日的中午，就会想到\r\n那个节目喔。在难波的著名剧场\r\n进行的──那个节目！",
      "source_fingerprint": "02eb6cb44006e670877047e98e288f4f4be10b166cfb3f6142f4c8360221d658",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91010"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:48d4baef2f5e237b98ca724a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "打个电话回家好了。\r\n爸爸妈妈动不动就逞强……\r\n真的是没办法抛下他们不管。",
      "source_fingerprint": "b41179b1f68d4fa341f28471c6e4ad6326e77451b120483e27afc62118312399",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:78a5b92510318bc669895ca1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这边的樱饼，\r\n饼皮的部分好～～～薄喔。\r\n这样能吃饱吗……？",
      "source_fingerprint": "03040176b58d46b05bef1ef34a82759acc53047e04368366e20d1e8b739dbeb6",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e79da2e0cc96f5d983946aaa",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "想喝冰凉的糖水了。\r\n虽然刚开始觉得味道很怪，\r\n但渐渐就喝上瘾了呢！",
      "source_fingerprint": "de60ef1e3595e0a9875bafe3d9d2bd36dd34c0a0a404a6d89293be70bd00d02b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91013"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5418eb28da61f9c77ae4f0f0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "热的乌龙面很好吃，\r\n但乌龙冷面也很好吃耶……\r\n在这种时节，真让人犹豫……！",
      "source_fingerprint": "bd719fc5d9497c4a0a6c2d4b366987c0c949dd797a9d7251ab6b802bbaa09eb5",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91014"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7dcbca7491d4f5fcb10f8e80",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "让我告诉你撑过寒冬的小知识吧。\r\n……只要一直到处跑就不会冷咯。\r\n哇～哈哈哈！",
      "source_fingerprint": "15dc789bafe1a2edb93378812570c9573938ade51ead1c186a6859352c2542de",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91015"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:37fd6ee363f896e6aa784c38",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小不点们常常画我喔，\r\n嘿嘿，下次叫他们画画看\r\n我这身打扮吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "ebbe88fbe42738a7bf8510bcc917ab05e9344d578d925c879757a129be7262fe",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91016"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6d9ba2a014498e65b464e897",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "小溪那家伙一脸开心地想把这块布\r\n挂在我脖子上……这怎么看\r\n都不是围兜而是腰布吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3f3f09909047ced1e1d15351aee406613643a5d1c8d3abf085d655aa1467804",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91017"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b09b0ebbcb91d783cadc696",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我只是在想不知道「神马」有什么\r\n神秘的传说，为什么鲁道夫会突然\r\n笑出来……啊……！？",
      "source_fingerprint": "0f79bac50d4a70c9fdbc92c6a842861851e7958a45e840951304eacc5673a35d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91018"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:fe138c8dbc46310e7fbca945",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这发型是小栗帮我绑的。\r\n因为靠自己绑这么高很麻烦，\r\n而且她好像很擅长绑头发。",
      "source_fingerprint": "1df78b43864aeface29b61c234840dd557dcd1aedbc8ccb74b0d7ba744401523",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91019"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5f561021cd8da805c9d51b2f",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我穿成这样跟稻荷吵架，\r\n结果突然就打雷起风了……\r\n真是逃不过神明的眼睛啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "9d52cf77cd166185fbae2b3e14645f88895743c073269980ad48a2b5840fc206",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91020"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7570038ab0af03684c3073ef",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "欸，新的一天开始啰。\r\n还不打起精神？\r\n不然我来电你一下让你清醒好了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "8f49c8b1bc239394c2d30110d69bc80772913099dcd28a54dcced08c6179df4f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:2537e9ba618584a285ea22e3",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "午休时间老是有一群人到我面前\r\n排队，说想商量烦恼、许愿……\r\n我可没办法保佑愿望实现啊……",
      "source_fingerprint": "4952cca4caacfeb18318995f0f77350c43f3733acbe2d2dbe62a1a78af1af5a3",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:13d849bc385e08f74e0dc05a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "听着远方雷声有助于集中精神喔。\r\n我也常常边听边念书。\r\n有兴趣的话下次借你CD吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "d0fa331d7600bb73adbe064d2bb7aaccc47b4e81ff0b3b819cfd62631246b60d",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91023"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ea90e786f1d06497d971eca0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "我知道现在这季节很舒适，\r\n但可不能松懈喔。\r\n神明随时看在眼里啊。",
      "source_fingerprint": "908a7c137d7416caf363cc457e8abd8140a2a821a8a49159ef482465683e992b",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91024"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1f38335b2412be77f9fd18e7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "阳光太强时得躲到阴影处才行……\r\n穿着黑衣可是会越来越热，\r\n最后被煎成小玉烧的～",
      "source_fingerprint": "dc2660d8d4ae1ba8094954c41135d134691ed4927c4956590fe292b4230250ea",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91025"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:40aa43fec5fa9b712b5dd876",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这季节气候很干燥，\r\n记得要多喝水喔！\r\n只要喝水，就能精神百倍！！",
      "source_fingerprint": "99e9631b5d56624f652ee61da3a59d54999af0c297a502db3a3d60626994ed86",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91026"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9461ffd80de4aa1baa7d6c93",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "冬天得好好补充精力！\r\n在不勉强的范围内好好吃饱，\r\n一起度过这个冬天吧！",
      "source_fingerprint": "55795a34b391c5df5010621ba1fefdb16218480373cab06764fdd9795c8b2bd7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91027"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d210008e3f255c6fdbb200a7",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "大家都说我这身打扮很神圣耶。\r\n意思是说我是神明对吧？\r\n那……我应该就是吐槽之神啦！",
      "source_fingerprint": "9e65b5091fa743a3b95ac1f3455edc581f6c1a0f7f5d0f130cdf6c233e5921ae",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91028"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5bf5ff16ae14ca35333f8984",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "这副耳罩虽然会完全包住耳朵，\r\n但还是可以听得很清楚喔。\r\n哦！我听到有人在装傻欠吐槽喔！",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a3651f4d3ba9d4932f3ae05a8b870b64c076f97cea2638207736bbac706bc23",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "91029"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8704da8c2f94e56a64c554a1",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "赶快开始吧！\r\n别浪费时间了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "318221b7fb8f6ddf2bbbfb76121be02b76322fd26cfb3dcdc239264b56eb6d00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0874b9ee00aa80843cd55f14",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "行くでぇ！",
      "source_fingerprint": "d054221f2f68cebdeb3e707011c8aa079b51f029722f2b93f7de0c387069b06f",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "920000"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d756ad0f62639b1faef0cfb0",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "感觉很棒的训练，就麻烦了！\r\n……总之，意思就是\r\n一切交给你了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2806aa2d9a52f16242b639de45c2b9ba6955e0409f14ce0f5c8a1539c377e1d7",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92001"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:08159163cc05fb14017c7ced",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "特雷森学园好厉害啊。\r\n设施充实的程度真不是盖的！\r\n这样我也能在巨星之道上勇往直前了！",
      "source_fingerprint": "3c420cd2817f3ecbe85f3c5ea09288cc2f7e9068652e25cf261e55df50c41c00",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92002"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:4b9e0656f316ddb97b291f3a",
      "kind": "character_system_text",
      "source_text": "拜托要让我大获全胜喔。\r\n可不能辜负了\r\n小不点他们的期待！",
      "source_fingerprint": "2b842ddc16ba33803a1bd5c10d89ba7feb800ec7125c00e66f2417740b52bc28",
      "source_path": "character_system_text_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "1021",
        "92003"
      ]
    }
  ]
}
